n and stdout are both terminals and `TERM` isn't `dumb`. `--no-ui`, a pipe or `TERM=dumb` keep today's output. `--ui` forces it and fails with exit 2 if there is no terminal. `--ui` together with `--no-ui` is also exit 2.\n- **Logs:** while the UI runs, log output goes to `~/.ard/logs/<owner>/<repo>/serve.log` (0600, rotated to `serve.log.1` at 10 MiB). The header shows the path and `logs: <path>` is printed on exit.\n- **Screen:** it redraws every second from the in-process Snapshot with no GitHub calls. Next tick per loop and recent events show only on terminals of at least 100x40. Every string drawn from outside goes through a sanitiser that strips control characters and escape sequences.\n- **Keys:** `?`, `j`/`k`/arrows, `o` to open the issue in the browser, `q` with a confirm, and Ctrl-C to stop gracefully.\n- **Proposal:** the \"Command center\" paragraph is added under Observability in `docs/proposal.md`.\n\n## Caveats\n- **Design issue not read:** #407 wasn't readable from this checkout, so the panel wording follows the issue slice and the Snapshot fields.\n- **No issue titles:** the Snapshot has no issue titles, so the issues panel shows number, state, jobs and cost.\n- **Child output:** child process output already goes to per-job log files, so only the controller's own stderr and slog output are redirected.\n- **Pre-existing noise:** `go vet` still prints a parse note for a roles testdata file; this predates the change.\n\nI wrote the report to `.ard/414/worker-engineer.md`.","ttft_ms":1030,"type":"result","duration_ms":467426,"uuid":"4bc18402-51d2-451c-81f9-0823c8c9cfbe","ttft_stream_ms":676,"time_to_request_ms":25,"first_content_frame_ms":676,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":52,"outputTokens":25756,"cacheReadInputTokens":1157866,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57032,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6015786000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":2363